<h1 class="display" style="margin:0;font-size:clamp(48px,5.6vw,84px);line-height:.98">Find your bearings</h1>
<p class="display" style="margin:14px 0 0;font-size:clamp(24px,2.4vw,32px);font-style:italic;color:#1C4F6B;line-height:1.2">with the best psychological game I've ever come across.</p>
<p style="margin:20px 0 0;font-size:18px;line-height:1.7;color:#3E4852">I first recorded it in Hungarian in 2016, and it still surprises me. It takes about five quiet minutes, your imagination and a pen. There are no wrong answers here, only pictures, and I'll help you read them at the end.</p>
</div>
