<!-- BEFORE YOU PRESS PLAY -->
<section style="max-width:1100px;margin:0 auto;padding:50px 24px 10px">
<p class="hand" style="margin:0;font-size:26px;color:#8A5129;text-align:center">Before you press play</p>
<ol style="list-style:none;margin:22px 0 0;padding:0;display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:22px;justify-content:center">
<li style="flex:1 1 220px;max-width:250px;text-align:center"><span class="hand" style="display:inline-flex;width:52px;height:52px;border-radius:50%;border:1.5px solid #B87345;align-items:center;justify-content:center;font-size:28px;color:#8A5129">1</span><p class="display" style="margin:10px 0 0;font-size:26px">Think freely.</p><p style="margin:6px 0 0;font-size:15px;line-height:1.6;color:#4A5560">Let your imaginary self wander wherever it wants.</p></li>
<li style="flex:1 1 220px;max-width:250px;text-align:center"><span class="hand" style="display:inline-flex;width:52px;height:52px;border-radius:50%;border:1.5px solid #B87345;align-items:center;justify-content:center;font-size:28px;color:#8A5129">2</span><p class="display" style="margin:10px 0 0;font-size:26px">Everything counts.</p><p style="margin:6px 0 0;font-size:15px;line-height:1.6;color:#4A5560">Colour, size, material, mood. Notice all of it.</p></li>
<li style="flex:1 1 220px;max-width:250px;text-align:center"><span class="hand" style="display:inline-flex;width:52px;height:52px;border-radius:50%;border:1.5px solid #B87345;align-items:center;justify-content:center;font-size:28px;color:#8A5129">3</span><p class="display" style="margin:10px 0 0;font-size:26px">Trust the first picture.</p><p style="margin:6px 0 0;font-size:15px;line-height:1.6;color:#4A5560">Whatever shows up first is the one. Don't edit it.</p></li>
<li style="flex:1 1 220px;max-width:250px;text-align:center"><span class="hand" style="display:inline-flex;width:52px;height:52px;border-radius:50%;border:1.5px solid #B87345;align-items:center;justify-content:center;font-size:28px;color:#8A5129">4</span><p class="display" style="margin:10px 0 0;font-size:26px">Keep a pen close.</p><p style="margin:6px 0 0;font-size:15px;line-height:1.6;color:#4A5560">Pause the video any time and write it down.</p></li>
</ol>
